1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,400
Ana wants to rent an apartment
in Passo Fundo.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,600
Her landlord wants a guarantor.

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:09,800
MUTAV is that guarantor,
and its reserve runs on Solana.

4
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:13,300
19 agencies signed letters of intent
with MUTAV.

5
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:16,900
Solana gives them a transparent reserve
and programmable payments.

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,600
Our operator puts Ana's lease on-chain:
R$18,000 of cover,

7
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:26,500
an opaque ID, no personal data.

8
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:33,200
Anyone can watch the reserve:
what it holds in BRS,

9
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:37,000
Nora's Brazilian real stablecoin,
and what it must hold.

10
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:38,900
The rule is code.

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,800
One more lease would need R$45,000;
the reserve holds R$44,500.

12
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:48,400
Refused.

13
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:52,000
MUTAV can't promise
what its reserve can't back.

14
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:00,200
Say Ana misses a month.

15
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:03,600
The operator files the claim,

16
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:08,600
the reserve pays
within the admin's cap,

17
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:14,700
and the PIX to the landlord
is recorded on-chain.

18
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:20,400
On-chain, filed to settled
in [N] seconds.

19
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:24,200
Seguro-fiança allows
up to thirty days.

20
00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:30,300
Today our operator console
signs these steps.

21
00:01:30,700 --> 00:01:33,600
Next, the agency platform
drives them automatically,

22
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:37,600
registry, claims and payments, inside
safeguards the program already enforces.

23
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:44,800
Here are six months of it,
simulated locally on an accelerated clock.

24
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:50,200
Guarantee fees and the reserve's yield
flow in; small claims flow out.

25
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:58,400
The reserve can back more leases,
each share is worth more,

26
00:01:58,700 --> 00:02:02,400
and a capital provider takes out
more than they put in.

27
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:08,200
The same reserve that protects
the landlord pays the people who fund it.

28
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:10,200
Verify everything on Solana.

29
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:13,600
MUTAV: a transparent,
programmable reserve,

30
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:16,600
claims settled in minutes,
capital that works.

31
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:18,900
Brazil's onchain rent guarantee.
